# Resource intake

When the user, Michael's Cursor bot, or Grok files a book, fund letter, VIC writeup, or other research PDF, follow `_system/agents/MICHAEL.md` (VIC-only: `_system/agents/GROK.md`). Do not leave the file only in chat or Downloads.

## Route

| Kind | Drive | Vault / SSI |
|------|-------|-------------|
| Fund / LP letter | `Letters/{YYYY Qn}/` | `research-vault/superinvestor-letters/{YYYY}Q{n}/` then `make letter-import-drive` |
| Book / wisdom (authorized) | `Research Sources/Investment Wisdom/{author}/` | `research-vault/investment-wisdom/{author}/` (`.txt` + README) |
| Manager meeting | `Manager Meetings/{YYYY-MM-DD}/` | `research-vault/manager-meetings/{YYYY-MM-DD}/` |
| VIC / research / company / activist | `Admin/Intake/{Kind}/{TICKER}/` (Grok: `drive_intake_drop.py --kind VIC`) | SSI `{TICKER}/` (not the vault) |

## Do not

- Put letters or books in `Admin/Intake`
- Put books in `Letters/`
- Commit licensed PDFs to this operational repo
- Invent new Drive roots
- Edit `_system/memory/MEMORY.md`
